-- The rules of boolean-rules.l4 and in-file-rules.l4 that may refuse, under
-- the same names, with each REFUSE replaced by FALSE: what the surfaces do
-- with these rules once the refusal is taken away. No rule here can refuse,
-- so no query planner may decline one, and a planner that answers must give
-- the answer the rule gives. See boolean-rules.l4 for what an "agreement:"
-- line says, and for `pad`.
--
-- agreement: covered may refuse with []
-- agreement: covered {"adult": true, "applicant": true} => answers true
-- agreement: covered {"adult": true, "applicant": false} => answers false
-- agreement: covered {"adult": false, "applicant": true} => answers false
-- agreement: covered {"adult": false, "applicant": false} => answers false
--
-- agreement: checked may refuse with []
-- agreement: checked {"adult": true, "applicant": true} => answers true
-- agreement: checked {"adult": true, "applicant": false} => answers false
-- agreement: checked {"adult": false, "applicant": true} => answers false
-- agreement: checked {"adult": false, "applicant": false} => answers false
--
-- agreement: settled may refuse with []
-- agreement: settled {"adult": true, "applicant": true} => answers true
-- agreement: settled {"adult": true, "applicant": false} => answers false
-- agreement: settled {"adult": false, "applicant": true} => answers false
-- agreement: settled {"adult": false, "applicant": false} => answers false
--
-- agreement: eligible may refuse with []
-- agreement: eligible is planned from its inputs
-- agreement: eligible {"adult": true, "resident": true} => answers true
-- agreement: eligible {"adult": true, "resident": false} => answers false
-- agreement: eligible {"adult": false, "resident": true} => answers false
-- agreement: eligible {"adult": false, "resident": false} => answers false

GIVEN person IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`the person is insured` person MEANS
    IF person THEN TRUE
    ELSE FALSE

GIVEN person IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`the person is resident` person MEANS
    IF person THEN TRUE
    ELSE FALSE

@export whether the applicant is covered
GIVEN adult IS A BOOLEAN
      applicant IS A BOOLEAN
      pad IS A MAYBE NUMBER
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE covered IF adult AND `the person is insured` applicant

@export whether the applicant is checked
GIVEN adult IS A BOOLEAN
      applicant IS A BOOLEAN
      pad IS A MAYBE NUMBER
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE checked IF
    IF adult THEN `the person is insured` applicant
    ELSE FALSE

@export whether the applicant is settled
GIVEN adult IS A BOOLEAN
      applicant IS A BOOLEAN
      pad IS A MAYBE NUMBER
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE settled IF adult AND `the person is resident` applicant

@export whether the applicant is eligible
GIVEN adult IS A BOOLEAN
      resident IS A BOOLEAN
      pad IS A MAYBE NUMBER
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE eligible IF adult AND (resident OR FALSE)
